<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">Rom</book>
  <para style="h">Romi Kaane Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔli Alaa Falan Naxan Nasiga Romi Kaane Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romi Kaane</para>
  <para style="mt1">Romi Kaane</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alaa Falan Naxan Nasiga Romi Kaane Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɲɛɛ dando dangu xanbini Yesu faxan nun a kenla sayani, Yahudiya dɛnkɛlɛya muxune yi Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nali fɔlɔ Romi taani, manga taana. Nanara, benun Pɔli xa kawandin ba waxatin naxan yi Siriya nun Asi nun Girɛki yamanane yi, dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan yi fa Romi taani. Ala to a fala Pɔli xa fa fala a a xa siga han dunuɲa danna, a yi waxi siga feni Romi taan nun Esipaɲa yamanan nin dɛnaxanye sa Romi taan xanbi ra pon! A Kitabun yireni ito sɛbɛxi Romi taan dɛnkɛlɛya muxune nan ma a sigatiin xili yi naxanye yi e malanma Pirisila nun Akila konni. A yi waxi a xɔn ma nɛn, ne xa a mali a sigatini, e sena ndee so a yii alogo a xa sa na yire makuyen li dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan munma yi sɔtɔ dɛnaxan yi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔli yi katama Kitabun yireni ito yi nɛn a xa a yita mɛnna dɛnkɛlɛya muxune ra a tan a xɛrayaan nakamalima kii naxan yi siya gbɛtɛne yɛ. Kitabun yireni ito Pɔli a kawandi ti kiin nan yɛbama dangu Kitabun yire gbɛtɛye ra a naxanye sɛbɛ alogo mɛn kaane xa tin a mali feen ma. A tan yɛtɛɛn bata a kawandin falani so iki, a naxa, “N mi yagixi Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin naliyɛ, bayo Ala sɛnbɛn na a ra alogo naxan yo na la a ra, na xa kisi, fɔlɔ Yahudiyane ma siga siya gbɛtɛne ma.” (Romi Kaane 1.16).</para>
  <para style="ip">Xɛra Pɔli waxatini, matandi wuyaxi yi Yahudiyane nun siya gbɛtɛne tagi dɛnkɛlɛya muxune yɛ. A gbengbenna, siya gbɛtɛ muxune na findi dɛnkɛlɛya muxune ra, xa a yi lanma ne xa Yahudiyane sariyan suxu hanma e nama a suxu. Na yi findixi matandi gbeen nan na han a fe yi fala Pɔli a kɛdi wuyaxi yi. Kitabun yireni ito yi, Pɔli a falama a a Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin naxan nalima, na siyane birin nan gbee ra (Romi Kaane 1.16). A mɔn a yɛbama Ala hakɛ kanne rakisima kii naxan yi, a findi ndenden na, naxan dɛnkɛlɛyaxi Yesu ma (Romi Kaane 1.18 han 8.39).</para>
  <para style="ip">Na xanbi ra, a yi a fala Alaa falan nakamalima kii naxan yi Yahudiyane fe ra hali Yahudiya muxuna ndee to tondi Yesu yatɛ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin na. A falama a na tondin mi nɔɛ Alaa falan kalɛ bayo dɔnxɛn na, a hinanna ne fan lima nɛn (Keli Romi Kaane sora 9 ma han 11). Na kui, Ala bata hinan siya gbɛtɛne fan na benun Yahudiyane mɔn xa xɛtɛ a ma waxatin naxan yi alogo Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin xa siya gbɛtɛne li, e yi dunuɲa yi gidi sariɲanxin liga. (Keli Romi Kaane 12.1 ma han 15.13).</para>
  <para style="ip">A raɲanna, Pɔli a falama e xa fa fala a wama siga feni Romi taan nun Esipaɲa yamanani alogo a xa Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nali mɛn kaane fan ma. A yi Romi kaane xɔntɔn (15.14 han 16.27). Naxanye birin wama a kolon feni Ala muxune rakisima kii naxan yi, Kitabun yireni ito e malima nɛn na ra.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔli Xibarun Faɲin naxan nalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>N tan Pɔli, Alaa Muxu Sugandixina Yesu a walikɛna, Ala bata naxan xili alogo n xa findi a xɛraan na, a yi n yɛba alogo n xa Alaa falan Xibaru Faɲin nali, n bata ito sɛbɛ ɛ ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Ala yamaan tuli sa Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲini ito nan na a nabine falane xɔn e Kitabu Sariɲanxine kui. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>A dii xɛmɛna fe nan yi a ra, naxan barixi Dawuda bɔnsɔnni fati bɛndɛn mabinni, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin mɔn yi a mayita sɛnbɛni fa fala a Alaa Dii Xɛmɛn nan a ra, bayo en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin bata keli sayani. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Ala bata nxu findi xɛrane ra a hinanni Yesu xinla barakani alogo siyane birin xa a xuiin suxu dɛnkɛlɛyani. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Ɛ tan fan na muxune yɛ, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu bata naxanye xili.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Awa, ɛ tan naxanye birin Romi taani, Ala xanuntenne, a mɔn naxanye xili, ɛ yi findi a yama sariɲanxin na, n bata ito sɛbɛ ɛ birin ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">En Fafe Ala nun Marigi Yesu, a Muxu Sugandixin xa hinanna nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi ɛ ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandin nun barika birana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>N barikan nan singe birama Ala xa ɛ birin ma fe ra, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu barakani. Amasɔtɔ muxune ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyana fe falama dunuɲa yiren birin yi. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Ala nan n seren na, n walima naxan xa a Dii Xɛmɛna fe Xibaru Faɲin nalini n niin birin na. A a kolon a n miriyana ɛ xɔn ma waxatin birin <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>n nɛma Ala maxandɛ waxati yo yi. N na Ala maxandima, xa a sagoon na a ra, a xa fɛrɛn fi n ma n siga ɛ konni. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ to xɔnla n ma kati, alogo Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin bata naxan fi n ma, n yi na nde radangu ɛ ma, ɛ yi sɛnbɛn sɔtɔ <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>alogo en yi en bode ralimaniya en ma dɛnkɛlɛyani.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ngaxakedenne, n waxi a xɔn ma ɛ xa a kolon, n bata yi kata nun sanɲa ma wuyaxi, n xa sa ɛ xɔntɔn koni n mi fɛrɛ sɔtɔ. N yi waxi a xɔn ma, n xa dɛnkɛlɛya muxuna ndee sɔtɔ ɛ konni alo n na a sɔtɔ siya gbɛtɛne yɛ kii naxan yi. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Goronna n xun ma n xa wali birin fɛma, Girɛkine nun xuluntarene e nun xaxilimane nun xaxilitarene. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Nanara, a xɔnla n ma han, n xa Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nali ɛ tan Romi kaane fan ma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲina sɛnbɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>N mi yagin Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin naliyɛ, bayo Ala sɛnbɛn na a ra alogo naxan yo na la a ra, na xa kisi, fɔlɔ Yahudiyane ma siga siya gbɛtɛne ma. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin bata tinxinyaan makɛnɛn, Ala naxan fima muxune ma. Na fɔlɔxi dɛnkɛlɛyaan nan ma a raɲan dɛnkɛlɛyaan ma, alo a sɛbɛxi kii naxan yi Kitabuni, a naxa, “Naxan na tinxin dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, na nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.17</char> Xabakuki 2.4</note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxune yalagi fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Ala bata a xɔlɔn makɛnɛn sa keli ariyanna yi lan muxune Ala kolontareyaan nun e tinxintareyaan ma naxanye ɲɔndin luxunma tinxintareyani. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Amasɔtɔ muxune nɔɛ naxan kolonɲɛ Ala fe yi, e bata na yigbɛ, bayo Ala bata yi na makɛnɛn e xa. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Bayo xabu dunuɲa da, Ala kɛɲaan naxanye mi toma yɛɛn na alo a habadan sɛnbɛn nun a Alayana, ne yigbɛma ki faɲi, bayo muxune e famuma a daala xɔn. Nanara, e mi nɔɛ e yɛtɛ xun mafalɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Hali e to Ala kolon, e mi a binyama, e mɔn mi barikan birama a xa. Koni e miriyane bata lu fuyan. E xaxilitareyaan yi e bɔɲɛne lu dimini. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>E bata e yɛtɛ yatɛ xaxilimane ra, koni e findi daxune ra. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>E bata habadan Alaa binyen masara suxurene ra naxanye rafalaxi muxune nun xɔline nun subene nun bubu seene maligan na naxanye faxama.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Nanara, Ala bata e rabeɲin e xɔsi feene yi e bɔɲɛne kunfaxi naxanye xɔn, e yi lu e bode fati rayelefuɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>E yi Alaa ɲɔndin masara wulen na, e wali dali seene xa, e yi e batu, benun e xa daala kanna Ala yɛtɛɛn batu naxan lan a batu han habadan. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Na feene ma, Ala yi e lu e kunfa fe rayelefuxi xɔsixine yi. Amasɔtɔ hali e ɲaxanle fan bata e mɛ e da kiin na, e kafu ɲɔxɔya gbɛtɛye liga naxanye mi daxa. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Xɛmɛne fan na kii nin, e yi e mɛ e ɲaxanle kafu ɲɔxɔyaan na, e yi e bode rakunfa. Xɛmɛn nun xɛmɛn yi e bode rayagi e kafu. E yi e fe ɲaxin saranna sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Bayo e to bata tondi Ala kolonɲɛ, a bata e rabeɲin e xaxilitareyani, e yi lu fe haramuxine ligɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>E lugoxi tinxintareyaan sifan birin na, fe ɲaxin nun milɛn nun ɲaxuna. E lugoxi xɔxɔlɔnyaan nun faxa ti xɔnla nun lantareyaan nun yanfantenyaan nun maraɲaxun nun muxu mafalan na. <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>E bata findi muxu xili kalane nun Ala yaxune nun yanda muxune nun wasodene nun muxu kanbaxine ra, e fe ɲaxi kɔtɛ nɛnɛne raminima, e murutɛ e bari muxune ma. <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>Xaxilitarene nun lannayatarene nun hinantarene nun kininkinintarene nan e ra. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Anu, e Alaa sariya tinxinxin kolon, a muxun naxanye feni itoe ligama, ne lan nɛn, e faxa. Hali na, e luma na feene nan ligɛ tun, a mɔn nafan e ma muxu gbɛtɛye fan yi ne liga.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa kitina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>I findi ndenden na, i tan naxan bodene yalagima, i mi nɔɛ i yɛtɛ xun mafalɛ. Amasɔtɔ i bodene yalagin feen naxanye ma, i tan fan yɛtɛɛn ne ligama. Nayi, i bata i yɛtɛɛn fan yalagi. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>En na a kolon Ala kiti tinxinxin sama nɛn muxune ma, naxanye fe sifani itoe ligama. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Koni i laxi a ra a i tan minɛ Alaa kitin bun ba, i tan naxan bodene yalagima feene ma i tan yɛtɛɛn naxanye ligama? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Hanma i yoxi Alaa nɛma fisamanten gbeen ma ba, e nun a diɲana? I mi a kolon a Alaa fanna lan nɛn a yi i sigati kiin maxɛtɛ ba? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Koni i ya tengbesenyaan ma, i mi waxi i bɔɲɛn maxɛtɛ feni. Nanara, i luma Alaa xɔlɔn fari sɛ naxan namaraxi i xili ma, a yi i li Alaa kiti tinxinxin na mini kɛnɛnni waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Amasɔtɔ na waxatini, Ala “muxun birin saranma nɛn a kɛwanle ra.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.6</char> A mato Yaburin 62.13 nun Sandane 24.12 kui.</note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>A habadan nii rakisin fima nɛn muxune ma naxanye na e tunnafan fe faɲin ligadeni e yi binyen nun xunnayerenna nun faxatareyaan fen. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Koni a xɔlɔn nun a bɔɲɛ teen kelima nɛn muxune xili ma naxanye e yɛtɛ yigboma, e tondi ɲɔndin ma, e lu tinxintareyaan bun. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Awa, tɔrɔn nun kɔntɔfinle sama nɛn fe ɲaxi rabane birin fari, fɔlɔ Yahudiyane ma siga siya gbɛtɛne ma. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Koni Ala binyen nun xunna kenla nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla fima nɛn fe faɲi rabane ma, fɔlɔ Yahudiyane ma siga siya gbɛtɛne ma. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala mi muxune rafisama e bode xa.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Naxanye birin yulubin ligama, e mi Musaa sariyan bun, ne halagima nɛn hali ba na sariyan na. Koni naxanye birin yulubin ligama Musaa sariyan bun, ne yalagima nɛn sariyan xɔn. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Amasɔtɔ naxan na a tuli mati sariyan na, na xa mi Ala kɛnɛnxi koni naxan na sariyan suxu, Ala na nan yatɛxi tinxin muxun na. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Awa, siya gbɛtɛn naxanye mi Musaa sariyan kolon ne na fena nde liga naxan daxa sariyani e gbee muxuyaan xɔn, ne bata e gbee sariyan namini hali Musaa sariyan to mi yi e yii. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Na a yitama nɛn a sariyan yamarin naxan fixi, na yi sɛbɛxi e bɔɲɛn nin. E yɛtɛ xaxinla fan luma e kawandɛ, a yi e fe kalan yita e ra waxatina nde, a mɔn yi e kɛwanle xun mayɛngɛ waxati gbɛtɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>A ligama na kii nin Ala na mini muxune wundo feene makitideni lɔxɔn naxan yi a Muxu Sugandixin Yesu barakani, alo n Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin naxan nalima, na a falan kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudiyane nun sariyana fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Koni i tan naxan a falama a Yahudiyan nan i ra, i yengi saxi sariyan ma, i yɛtɛ matɔxɔma Ala yi, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>i a sagoon kolon, sariyan bata i xaran fe fisamantenna sugandin ma. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>I laxi a ra fa fala a danxutɔne yii rasuxun nan i tan na, e nun kɛnɛnna naxan muxune malima dimini, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>naxan xaxilitarene xaranma e nun diidine karamɔxɔna, bayo i laxi a ra a i bata fe kolonna nun ɲɔndin yɛtɛɛn sɔtɔ sariyani. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Nayi, i tan naxan bonne xaranma, i yɛtɛ xaranma ba? I tan naxan kawandin bama a muxun nama muɲan ti, i tan mi muɲan tiin ba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>I tan naxan tɔnna dɔxɔma yalunyaan na, i tan mi yalunyaan ligan ba? Suxurene raɲaxu i tan naxan ma, i mi e batu banxine kui seene tongon ba? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>I i yɛtɛ matɔxɔma sariyani, koni i Ala matandima sariya kalan xɔn! <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Amasɔtɔ, Kitabun naxa, “Ala xinla rayelefuxi siya gbɛtɛne yɛ ɛ tan nan ma fe ra.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.24</char> Esayi 52.5</note><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Yahudiyane banxulanna lan, xa i sariyan suxu. Koni xa sariya kalan nan i ra, hali i banxulanxi, i fa yatɛxi nɛn alo siya gbɛtɛ banxulantarena. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Siya gbɛtɛn naxanye mi banxulanxi, xa ne sariyan suxu, Ala mi na yatɛ alo Yahudiya sariya suxune ba? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Xa banxulantarena Alaa sariyan suxu, a mi i tan Yahudiya banxulanna yalagɛ ba? Amasɔtɔ i sariyan kalama, hali a sɛbɛxin to i yii. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Yahudiya dinan maligan muxun naxan yi, na mi findixi Yahudiya kɛndɛ yɛtɛɛn na. Banxulan feen mi findixi fati bɛndɛna fe gbansanna ra. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Koni muxun findima Yahudiya kɛndɛn na a kui feene nan xɔn. Banxulanya kɛndɛn luma muxun bɔɲɛn nin fata Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin na. Sariya sɛbɛxi mi a ra. Na muxu sifan mi tantunna sɔtɔma adamadiine ra fɔ Ala yɛtɛna.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Nanse Yahudiyane rafisaxi muxun bonne xa nayi? Banxulanna tɔnɔn nanse ra? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Tɔnɔ wuyaxi a ra kiin birin yi. A singen naxan na, Ala bata a falane birin taxu Yahudiyane ra. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Awa, na di, xa dɛnkɛlɛyaan mi muxuna ndee yi, na Alaa tinxinna kalɛ ba? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Ɛn-ɛn de! Ɲɔndin kanna nan Ala ra hali muxune birin findi wule falane ra. A sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, a naxa, “Nanara, i na falan ti, i tan nan tinxin. I na kitin sa, i yoon sɔtɔ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.4</char> Yaburin 51.6</note><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Koni xa en ma tinxintareyana Alaa tinxinna raminima kɛnɛnni, en nanse falama lan na feen ma? Ala mi tinxintareyaan xan ligama nayi, a na a xɔlɔn nagodo en ma? N falan tima alo muxune. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Ɛn-ɛn de! Xa a yi na kii nin nun, Ala nɔɛ dunuɲa makitɛ di?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Koni na di? Xa Alaa ɲɔndin makɛnɛnma n ma wulen nan xɔn, a binyen yi fari sa, nanfera n tan mɔn yalagɛ nayi alo yulubi kanna? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Nayi, nanfera en mi a falama, en naxa, “En fe ɲaxin liga alogo a xa yatɛ fe faɲin na?” Wule falana ndee na falan sama nxu xun ma. Na kanne yalagi daxin na a ra.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muxu yo mi na naxan tinxin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>A di nayi? Nxu tan fisa bonne xa ba? Ɛn-ɛn de! En bata yi a yigbɛ nun fa fala Yahudiyane nun siya gbɛtɛne birin yulubin sɛnbɛn bun ma, <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>alo a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni kii naxan yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">“Tinxin muxu yo mi na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">hali keden pe!<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Muxu yo mi na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">naxan fe kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">Muxu yo mi na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">naxan Ala fenma.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Muxun birin bata kiraan fata.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">E birin bata lu fufafu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">Muxu yo mi a faɲin nabama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">hali muxu keden pe!<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>E kɔɛ yinle rabixi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">alo gaburuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">yanfa falane nan e lɛnne ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">E fala xuine xɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">alo koson xɔlɛna.<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>E dɛɛn nafexi dangane nun fala xui xɔlɛne nan na.<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>E mafura wuli raminideni.<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Gbalon nun kalan nan e kirane xɔn.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>E mi bɔɲɛ xunbenla kiraan kolon!<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>E mi gaxuma Ala yɛɛ ra mumɛ!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.10-18</char> Yaburin 14.1-3 nun 53.2-4 nun 5.10 nun 140.4 e nun Esayi 59.7-8 nun Yaburin 36.2</note><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Anu, en na a kolon a sariyan naxan birin falama, a falama muxune nan xa naxanye sariyan bun, alogo birin dɛɛn xa suxu, dunuɲa muxune birin yi kolon fe kalane ra Ala yɛtagi. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Nanara, adamadi yo mi yatɛxi tinxin muxun na Ala yɛɛ ra yi sariya suxun xɔn, bayo sariyan yulubin nan tun yitama en na.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Koni iki, ba sariyan na, tinxinna nde bata mini kɛnɛnni Ala naxan fima muxune ma, Sariya Kitabun nun nabine kitabune bata yi naxan seren ba. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Naxanye birin na dɛnkɛlɛya, Ala ne ratinxinma a yɛɛ ra yi nɛn dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn Yesu yi, Alaa Muxu Sugandixina. Amasɔtɔ tagi raba mi na. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Muxun birin bata yulubin liga. Nanara, e mi Alaa binyen sɔtɔxi. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Koni Ala muxune kima tinxinni a hinanna nan xɔn, a yi e xunba a Muxu Sugandixin Yesu barakani. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Ala a tan nan findixi a solona saan na e nun yulubi xafari saraxana, na muxune xa naxanye na dɛnkɛlɛya a wunla ma. Na bata a gbee tinxinna yita. Bayo yulubin naxanye liga benun iki, a mi yi muxune yulubine saranma e ra a diɲan waxatini, <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>koni a bata wa a tinxinna yita feni waxatini ito yi, alogo a xa tinxin feu, a mɔn yi muxune ratinxinɲɛ ayi a yɛɛ ra yi naxanye bata dɛnkɛlɛya Yesu ma.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Nayi, muxune lan e xa e yɛtɛ matɔxɔ nanfe ma? Sese! Nanfera? E to sariyan suxi, e yɛtɛ matɔxɔma na nan na ba? Ɛn-ɛn, na mi a ra, fɔ e dɛnkɛlɛyana. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Amasɔtɔ en bata a to muxun tinxinma Ala yɛɛ ra yi dɛnkɛlɛyaan nan xɔn, hali ba sariya suxun na. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Yahudiyane nan tun gbee Ala ra ba? Siya gbɛtɛne fan ma Ala xa mi a tan na ba? Siya gbɛtɛne fan ma Ala na a ra yati! <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Ala kedenna na a ra naxan Yahudiyane ratinxinma a yɛɛ ra yi dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn e nun siya gbɛtɛne fan na dɛnkɛlɛya kedenna xɔn. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Na bunna nɛɛn a en xa sariyan beɲin dɛnkɛlɛyani ba? Ɛn-ɛn de! En lan nɛn en yi sariyan yatɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Iburahima misaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>En nanse falama en siyaan benba Iburahima a fe yi nayi? A nanse kolonxi feni ito yi? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Xa Iburahima tinxinɲɛ ayi nɛn Ala yɛɛ ra yi a kɛwanla xɔn, a yi a yɛtɛ matɔxɛ nɛn na yi. Koni a mi nɔɛ na ligɛ Ala yɛtagi! <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Kitabun nanse falaxi lan na fe ma? A naxa, “Iburahima yi dɛnkɛlɛya Ala ma, Ala yi na yatɛ tinxinna ra a xa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.3</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 15.6</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Muxun naxan na wali, a yi a saranna sɔtɔ, na mi yatɛma kiseen na a xa, bayo a wali saranna na a ra. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Koni muxun naxan mi walima, koni a laxi Ala ra naxan Ala kolontarene matinxinma, Ala na kanna dɛnkɛlɛyaan yatɛma nɛn tinxinna ra. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Dawuda fan muxuna sɛwana fe falaxi na kii nin, Ala naxan yatɛxi tinxin muxun na, ba kɛwanle ra, a naxa,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Sɛwan na kanna xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">naxan ma sariya kalane bata mafelu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">naxan yulubine bata xafari.<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Sɛwan na adaman xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">Marigin bata diɲa naxan hakɛn ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.8</char> Yaburin 32.1-2</note><verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Na sɛwan findixi Yahudiya banxulanxine nan gbansan gbee ra ba hanma siya gbɛtɛne fan? Awa, en baxi a faladeni, en naxa, a Ala Iburahimaa dɛnkɛlɛyaan yatɛ nɛn tinxinna ra a xa. <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Koni na liga waxatin mundun yi? A bata yi banxulan hanma a munma yi banxulan? A munma yi banxulan. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>A banxulanyaan sɔtɔ nɛn a tinxinyaan taxamasenna ra a naxan sɔtɔxi a dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn benun a xa banxulan waxatin naxan yi. Nanara, Iburahima yi findi muxune birin benban na naxanye dɛnkɛlɛyaxi Ala ma, na yi yatɛ e xa tinxinna ra hali e mi banxulanxi. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Naxanye banxulanxi, e mɔn biraxi nxu benba Iburahima dɛnkɛlɛyaan fɔxɔ ra Iburahima yi naxan yi nun benun a xa banxulan, ne fan benban nan Iburahima ra.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala Iburahima tuli sa naxan na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Ala yi Iburahima nun a bɔnsɔnna tuli sa, a naxa, dunuɲa findima nɛn e kɛɛn na. Koni a mi na tuli saan sɔtɔxi sariyan xan xɔn fɔ a tinxinna dɛnkɛlɛyaan barakani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.13</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 12.2-3 nun 17.4-6 nun 22.15-18 kui.</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Xa muxune yi na kɛɛn sɔtɔxi sariya suxun nan xɔn nun, nayi dɛnkɛlɛyaan tɔnɔ mi na. Ala en tuli saxi nɛn nayi fuyan! <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Amasɔtɔ sariyan nan fama Alaa xɔlɔn na, bayo xa sariya mi na, sariya kalan fan mi na.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Nayi, Ala en tuli saxi dɛnkɛlɛyaan nan baraka yi, alogo a xa findi Alaa hinanna ra Iburahima yixɛtɛne birin xa naxanye sariyan sɔtɔxi e nun naxanye fan dɛnkɛlɛya alo Iburahima. Iburahima nan en birin benban na, <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>alo a sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui kii naxan yi, a naxa, “N na i findima nɛn siya wuyaxine benban na.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.17</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 17.5</note> A tan nan en benban na Ala yɛɛ ra yi, Iburahima dɛnkɛlɛya Ala naxan ma, Ala naxan faxa muxune niin birama e yi, Ala naxan seen yamarima naxan mi na, a yi taran na. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Iburahima dɛnkɛlɛya nɛn a yigin ma, hali a yigin xunna to mi yi toma. Na kiini, a yi findi “siya wuyaxine benban na,” alo Ala a fala a xa kii naxan yi, a naxa, “I yixɛtɛne luma na kii nin.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.18</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 15.5</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>A bata yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ ɲɔxɔndɔn sɔtɔ nun, fayida a fati bɛndɛn yi faxa feni, a ɲaxanla Saran fan yi findixi gbantan na koni a dɛnkɛlɛyaan tan yi kɛndɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Ala a tuli sa naxan na, a mi sikɛ na ma dɛnkɛlɛyatareyani, koni a dɛnkɛlɛyana a sɛnbɛ so nɛn, a yi Ala binya. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>A yi laxi a ra yati, fa fala Ala a tuli saxi naxan na, a sɛnbɛn na rakamalima nɛn. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Nanara, Ala na yatɛ nɛn tinxinna ra a xa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.22</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 15.6</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Koni na falan mi sɛbɛxi a tan keden ma fe ra, fa fala, “A yatɛxi tinxinna ra a xa.” <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>A mɔn sɛbɛxi en tan nan xa bayo na yatɛma tinxinna ra en tan fan xa, en na dɛnkɛlɛya Ala ma naxan en Marigi Yesu rakelixi sayani. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Yesu faxaxi en hakɛne nan ma fe ra, a yi keli sayani, a en natinxin Ala yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Tinxinyana fe Ala yɛɛ ra yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Bayo en bata tinxinɲɛ ayi Ala yɛɛ ra yi dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, lanna bata taran en nun Ala tagi Marigi Yesu barakani, Alaa Muxu Sugandixina. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>A bata en nafa a hinanni dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn en naxan yi iki. En yi sɛwa Alaa binyen sɔtɔ feen yigin na. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>En mɔn sɛwaxi en ma tɔrɔne ra amasɔtɔ en na a kolon a tɔrɔn fama tunnafanna nan na. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>Tunnafanna yi fa lannayaan na. Lannayaan yi fa yigin na. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Na yigin mi en yanfama, amasɔtɔ Ala bata a xanuntenyaan sa en bɔɲɛni a Nii Sariɲanxin xɔn ma, a bata naxan fi en ma.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Amasɔtɔ sɛnbɛ mi yi en na waxatin naxan yi, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin faxa nɛn Ala kolontarene fe ra a waxati ragidixini. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Fayida muxe mi yi tinɲɛ faxɛ tinxin muxuna fe ra, koni yanyina nde, muxuna nde susɛ nɛn faxɛ muxu faɲina fe ra. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Koni Ala a xanuntenyaan yitaxi en na na kii nin, en mɔn yi yulubi kanne ra waxatin naxan yi, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin yi faxa en xa. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Iki xa en bata tinxinɲɛ ayi Ala yɛɛ ra yi Yesu wunla xɔn ma, a mi sa taganɲɛ en kisɛ Alaa xɔlɔn ma a barakani. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Bayo xa Ala yaxun yi en na waxatin naxan yi, en nun Ala tagin yi yitɔn a Dii Xɛmɛna sayaan xɔn, xa en tagin bata yitɔn nayi, a tagan xun mi na nayi en nakisɛ Yesu a nii rakisin barakani. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Koni a birin mi na ra, en mɔn sɛwaxi Ala ra en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe ra naxan bata en nun Ala tagini tɔn iki.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">En Benba Adama nun Yesu a fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Nanara, yulubin soxi dunuɲa yi muxu keden peen nan xɔn ma, sayaan fan yi fa yulubin xɔn. Nanara, sayaan bata fa muxun birin ma, amasɔtɔ muxun birin bata yulubin liga. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Yulubin yi dunuɲa yi nun benun sariyan xa fa, anu xa sariyan mi na, yulubin fan mi yatɛma. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Koni fɔlɔ En Benba Adama waxatin ma han sa dɔxɔ Musa waxatin na, sayaan mangayaan ligama muxun birin xun na, hali naxanye mi En Benba Adamaa yulubin sifan liga naxan Alaa sariyan kala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">En Benba Adama yi findixi muxu famatɔɔn misaala nan na. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Koni Alaa kiseen mi maligaxi Adama hakɛn na. Hali muxu wuyaxi to bata sayaan sɔtɔ a tan kedenna hakɛn xɔn, Alaa hinanna nun a kiin hinanna gbo na xa, a naxan fixi muxu wuyaxi ma muxu keden peen barakan xɔn, Yesu, a Muxu Sugandixina. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Alaa kiseen nun muxu kedenni ito yulubin mɔn mi raɲanma fe kedenna ma. Bayo yulubi keden peen kitin bata a liga adamadiine yi yalagi, koni Alaa kiseen faxi yulubi wuyaxin liga xanbin nin, a yi tinxinyaan nafa. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Xa sayaan bata nɔɔn sɔtɔ muxu kedenna hakɛn xɔn, na muxu kedenna fe ra, na muxune fan mi taganɲɛ nɔɔn sɔtɛ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu kedenna dunuɲa yi gidin xɔn, naxanye Alaa hinan ɲantaren sɔtɔma e nun a kiseen naxan findixi tinxinna ra.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Nanara, birin yalagixi kii naxan yi hakɛ kedenna xɔn, kɛwali tinxinxi kedenni ito fan bata findi tinxinna ra na kiini naxan nii rakisin nafama muxune birin ma. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Amasɔtɔ muxu wuyaxi findixi hakɛ kanne ra kii naxan yi muxu kedenna fala suxutareyaan xɔn ma, muxu wuyaxi fan natinxinma ayi na kii nin Ala yɛɛ ra yi muxu kedenna a fala suxun barakani.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Sariyan bata fa alogo hakɛne xa wuya ayi, koni yulubin gboxi ayi dɛnaxan yi, Alaa hinanna fan bata gbo ayi mɛnni mɔn. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Nanara, yulubin mangayaan ligaxi kii naxan yi sayani, Alaa hinanna fan mangayaan ligama tinxinyaan xɔn ma na kii nin, a yi en naso habadan nii rakisini, en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Sayaan nun siimayana Yesu xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>En nanfe falama? En luyɛ yulubine ligɛ ba alogo Alaa hinanna xa gbo ayi? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Ɛn-ɛn de! En luxi nɛn alo en bata faxa yulubin mabinni, en mɔn luyɛ en ma dunuɲa yi gidin ligɛ yulubini di nayi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Ɛ mi a kolon ba, a en tan naxanye bata rafu igeni Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu xinli, a en bata rafu a xɔn ma a sayani? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Nayi, en nun Yesu bata maluxun en bode xɔn ma a sayani en nafuxi igeni waxatin naxan yi, alogo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin kelixi sayani kii naxan yi a fafe a binyeni, en fan xa sigan ti dunuɲa yi gidi nɛnɛni na kiini.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Amasɔtɔ xa en birin bata findi kedenna ra a sayani, en fan kelima nɛn sayani alo a tan. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>En xa ito kolon: en ma muxuya fonna bata faxa Yesu xɔn wudin ma, alogo en ma muxuyaan naxan yulubini, na xa ɲan, en yi ba yulubina konyiyani. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Amasɔtɔ muxun na faxa, a xɔrɔyama nɛn yulubin ma. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Xa en nun Alaa Muxu Sugandixin bata faxa en bode xɔn ma, en mɔn laxi a ra nayi fa fala en nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn en bode xɔn ma. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Amasɔtɔ en na a kolon fa fala Alaa Muxu Sugandixin bata keli sayani, a mi fa faxama sɔnɔn, sɛnbɛ mi fa sayaan na a fari sɔnɔn. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Amasɔtɔ a faxa nɛn, a faxa yulubin nan ma fe ra sanɲa ma keden han habadan. Iki a a nii ra, a siimayani Ala nan xa. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>A na kii nin, ɛ fan xa ɛ yɛtɛ yatɛ muxu faxaxine ra yulubin ma, koni ɛ luxi ɛ siimayani Ala xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu nin.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Nanara, yulubin nama fa mangayaan liga ɛ fati bɛndɛni sɔnɔn naxan faxama, ɛ lu a waxɔn feene ligɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Ɛ nama ɛ fatin yire yo lu yulubini alo yɛngɛ so sena tinxintareyaan xa, koni ɛ yɛtɛ so Ala yii, alo a bata muxun naxanye rakeli sayani. Ɛ fatin yiren birin so Ala nan yii yɛngɛ so seen na tinxinyaan xa. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Na ma, yulubin nama mangayaan liga ɛ xun na, bayo ɛ mi fa sariyan bun ma sɔnɔn, fɔ Alaa hinanna.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tinxinyana konyine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Na di nayi? A lan en xa lu yulubin ligɛ ba, bayo en mi fa sariyan bun ma sɔnɔn, fɔ Alaa hinanna? Ɛn-ɛn de! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Ɛ mi a kolon ba, ɛ na ɛ yɛtɛ so muxuna nde yii ɛ findi a xui suxu konyin na, ɛ findima na kanna konyin nan na ɛ naxan xui suxuma? A findɛ yulubin na, i yi faxa, hanma a findɛ Ala xuiin suxun na, i yi yatɛ tinxin muxun na. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Koni tantunna Ala xa, bayo yulubina konyin nan yi ɛ ra nun, koni xaranna naxan taxu ɛ ra, ɛ bata na suxu ɛ bɔɲɛni. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Ɛ bata xɔrɔya yulubin ma, ɛ findi tinxinyana konyine ra. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>N dunuɲa misaali ito falama ɛ xa nɛn alogo ɛ xa a yɛɛ to hali sɛnbɛ to mi ɛ yi. A fɔlɔni nun ɛ bata yi ɛ fatin birin findi xɔsi feene konyin na, ɛ kɛwali ɲaxine yi siga gboɛ ayi. Koni iki, ɛ fatin birin xa findi tinxinyana konyin na, ɛ yi sariɲan.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Ɛ yi yulubina konyiyani waxatin naxan yi, ɛ mi yi tinxinyaan bun ma nun. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Ɛ feen naxanye liga na waxatini, ɛ yagixi naxanye ra iki, ɛ tɔnɔn mundun sɔtɔxi ne yi? Ne raɲanna findixi sayaan nan na. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Koni iki, ɛ bata xɔrɔya yulubin ma, ɛ findi Alaa konyine ra. Ɛ marasariɲanna nan findixi na tɔnɔn na, naxan naɲan findixi habadan nii rakisin na. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Bayo yulubin saranna nan sayaan na koni Alaa kisena, habadan nii rakisin nan na ra en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixini.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Dɛnkɛlɛya muxune bata xɔrɔya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Ngaxakedenne, ɛ tan naxanye sariyan kolon, ɛ a kolon fa fala a sariyan muxun yamarima fanni a daxi. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>A misaala findixi ɲaxanla nan na naxan dɔxi xɛmɛn xɔn. Na nun a xɛmɛna e bode ra fanni a daxi, koni xa a xɛmɛn faxa, a bata mini sariyan bun naxan yi e xidixi e bode ra. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Nanara, xa a dɔxɔ xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ xɔn, a xɛmɛ singen mɔn a nii ra, a bata yalunyaan liga na yi. Koni xa a xɛmɛn faxa, nayi a bata mini na sariyan bun. Nayi, a nɔɛ dɔxɛ gbɛtɛ xɔn nɛn, na mi findixi yalunyaan na. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Ngaxakedenne, ɛ tan fan bata faxa sariyan mabinni Alaa Muxu Sugandixin fati bɛndɛn xɔn ma. Nayi, ɛ bata findi na gbeen na, naxan kelixi sayani alogo en xa wali faɲine kɛ Ala xa. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Amasɔtɔ fati bɛndɛn nafan feene yi en yamarima waxatin naxan yi, yulubin nafan fe ɲaxine yi walima en fatine yi sariyan xɔn alogo naxan en faxama en yi na liga. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Koni iki, en bata mini sariyan bun, amasɔtɔ en bata faxa sariyan bun, naxan yi en suxi. En fa Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina a kira nɛnɛn nan xɔn, en mi fa fe fori sɛbɛxine bun.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sariyan nun hakɛna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>En nanfe falama nayi? Sariyan yɛtɛɛn nan yulubin na ba? Ɛn-ɛn de! Sariyan nan a ligaxi n yulubin kolon. Xa sariyan mi yi a fala n xa nun, i nama mila ayi, n mi yi milan kolonma nun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">7.7</char> A mato Xɔrɔyaan 20.17 nun Sariyane 5.21 kui.</note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Na ma, yulubin yi fɛrɛn sɔtɔ, a milan sifan birin naso n tan yi sariyan xɔn ma. Amasɔtɔ xa sariyan mi yi na nun, yulubin faxaxin nan yi a ra. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Sariyan mi yi na waxatin naxan yi, n yi kɛndɛ, koni yamarin to fa, yulubin yi fa, n yi faxa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Yamarin naxan faxi siimayana fe ra, na faxi sayaan nan na n tan ma. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Bayo, yulubin bata fɛrɛn sɔtɔ yamarin xɔn, a yi n yanfa, a n faxa.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Nanara, sariyan sariɲan, yamarin sariɲan, a tinxin, a fan. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Na bunna di? Fa fala naxan fan, na bata findi sayaan na n tan xa? Ɛn-ɛn de! Yulubin nan bata n faxa na se faɲin xɔn, alogo a xa kolon yulubin na. Nayi, yulubin sɛnbɛ gbeen yi makɛnɛn yamarin xɔn.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yulubin yi muxun nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>En na a kolon fa fala a sariyan fataxi Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nan na, koni fati bɛndɛn nan n tan na, naxan bata mati a findi yulubina konyin na. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>N naxan ligama, n mi na bayen kolon. Amasɔtɔ n waxi naxan liga feni, n mi na xan ligama, koni fɔ naxan mi rafan n ma n na nan ligama. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>N mi waxi naxan liga feni, n na nan ligama. Na a yitama nɛn fa fala a n bata tin a sariyan fan. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Nayi, n tan xa mi na ligama, koni yulubin nan na ra naxan n yi. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Amasɔtɔ n na a kolon a fe faɲin mi n tan yi fata n fati bɛndɛn nafan feene ra, bayo hali fe faɲin liga xɔnla n ma, n mi nɔɛ a ligɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>N waxi fe faɲin naxan liga feni, n mi na xan ligama, koni n mi waxi fe ɲaxin naxan liga feni, n luma na nan ligɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Feen naxan liga xɔli mi n ma, xa n na liga, na bunna nɛɛn, fa fala n tan xa mi a ligaxi, koni yulubin naxan n yi.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Nanara, sariyan naxan walima n tan yi, na ni ito ra. Fe faɲin liga xɔnla n ma waxatin naxan yi, a fɛrɛ mi na bayo fe ɲaxina n yi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Anu, n sɛwaxi Alaa sariyan na n sondonni. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Koni n sariya gbɛtɛ nan toma n fati bɛndɛni naxan n xaxinla sariyan yɛngɛma, na yi n findi kasorasaan na yulubina sariyan xɔn ma, naxan walima n fati bɛndɛni. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Tɔrɔ muxun nan n na! Nde n xunbama fati bɛndɛni ito nun a rafan feene yi naxanye n xalima sayani? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Tantunna Ala xa en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Nayi, n bata findi Alaa sariyan konyin na n xaxinli, koni n fati bɛndɛn nafan feene bata n findi yulubina sariyana konyin na.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Nanara, muxun naxanye Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu yi, Ala mi fa ne yalagima. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Amasɔtɔ, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina nii rakisin sariyan bata n xɔrɔya yulubin nun sayaan sariyan ma Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu barakani. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Amasɔtɔ sariyan mi yi nɔɛ na ligɛ, bayo fati bɛndɛn nafan feene bata a sɛnbɛn ɲan. Ala nan na liga, a yi a yɛtɛna Dii Xɛmɛn nafa adamadi yulubi kanne sawurani, a yulubin yalagi fati bɛndɛni. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Ala na ligaxi nɛn alogo sariyan tinxinna xa kamali en yi, en tan naxanye mi fa en fati bɛndɛn nafan feene ligama, koni fɔ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nafan feene. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Awa, naxanye e fati bɛndɛn nafan feene ligama, ne luma e mirɛ na fe sifane nan ma, koni naxanye Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nafan feene ligama, ne luma e mirɛ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina feene nan ma. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Fati bɛndɛn natan miriyane na lu i yi, sayaan nan na ra, koni xa i miriyane keli Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nin, siimayaan nan na ra e nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Amasɔtɔ fati bɛndɛn natan miriyane findixi Ala yaxun nan na, bayo e mi nɔɛ i xurɛ Alaa sariyan bun mumɛ! <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Naxanye e fati bɛndɛn nafan feene ligama, ne mi Ala kɛnɛnɲɛ mumɛ!<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Koni ɛ tan mi fa ɛ fati bɛndɛn nafan feene ligama fɔ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nafan feene, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin to ɛ yi. Amasɔtɔ xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixina Niin mi muxun naxan yi, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin gbee mi na kanna ra. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Koni xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixina ɛ tan yi, ɛ fati bɛndɛn bata faxa yulubina fe ra, koni ɛ niina ɛ yi, amasɔtɔ ɛ bata ratinxinɲɛ ayi Ala yɛtagi. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Anu, Alaa Niin naxan Yesu rakelixi sayani, xa na lu ɛ yi, a tan naxan Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nakelixi sayani, na mɔn nii rakisin fima nɛn ɛ fati bɛndɛne ma a Nii Sariɲanxin barakani naxan luma ɛ yi.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Na ma, ngaxakedenne, goronna en xun ma. Koni fati bɛndɛn tan goronna mi en xun ma en yi a rafan feene liga. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Amasɔtɔ xa ɛ lu ɛ fati bɛndɛn nafan feene ligɛ, ɛ faxama nɛn. Koni xa ɛ fati bɛndɛn natane faxa Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin xɔn, ɛ nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin muxun naxanye yii rasuxi, Alaa diin nan ne ra. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ Niin naxan sɔtɔxi, na mi ɛ findixi gaxun konyin na. Koni a bata ɛ findi Alaa diine ra. En xinla tima na nan baraka yi, en naxa, “Baba, n fafe!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yɛtɛɛn sereyaan bama en niin xa, a Alaa diin nan en tan na. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>En to findixi Alaa diine ra, en fama nɛn kɛɛn sɔtɔdeni alo a diine bayo Ala barayin naxan namaraxi a Muxu Sugandixin nun a muxune xa, en na sɔtɔma nɛn. Xa en nun Yesu tɔrɔ en bode xɔn ma, en birin nan a binyen sɔtɔma nayi.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Binyen naxan fama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>N bata a kolon a en tɔrɔn naxan sɔtɔma iki, e nun binyen naxan fama, ne tagi kuya kati! <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Bayo daala birin luxi nɛn alo a Ala legedenma, a digima na waxatin na han Alaa diine nɔrɔn sa minima kɛnɛnni waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Amasɔtɔ daala lu nɛn kobiyaan bun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.20</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 3.17</note> A sago mi yi a ra, koni Ala sagoon nan a luxi na kiini alogo yigin xa sɔtɔ, <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>fa fala daala xɔrɔyama nɛn kalana konyiyaan ma, a yi fa Alaa diine xɔrɔya kɛndɛni. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Amasɔtɔ en na a kolon, xabu a fɔlɔni han waxatini ito yi, a luxi alo daala birin kutunma xɔlɛni alo ɲaxanla naxan dii barini. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Koni daala xa mi keden a ra, koni en tan naxanye fan singe Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin sɔtɔxi, en fan sɔxɔlɛxi en bɔɲɛni, en Ala mamɛma waxatin naxan yi a en findi a diine ra, a yi en gbindin xunba. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Amasɔtɔ en bata kisi na yigin xɔn. Anu, i yigin saxi feen naxan yi, xa i bata na to, na mi fa xilɛ yigina. En bata yelin naxan sɔtɛ, en fa en xaxili tima na ra di? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Koni en munma naxan sɔtɔ, xa en na en yigin sa na fari, en na a mamɛma nɛn tunnafanni.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina en tan sɛnbɛtare kanne malima na kii kedenna nin. Amasɔtɔ en mi a kolon en lan en xa Ala maxandi naxan ma. Koni Nii Sariɲanxin yɛtɛna Ala mafanma en xa kutunni naxan mi nɔɛ falɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Ala naxan muxune bɔɲɛ yi feene toma, na a Nii Sariɲanxina miriyaan kolon, amasɔtɔ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina Ala mafanma a yama sariɲanxin xa alo Ala sagoon kii naxan yi.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>En na a kolon a Ala feene birin naɲanma a faɲin nan ma a xanu muxune xa, a naxanye xilixi a maragidini. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala naxanye sugandi a fɔlɔni, a mɔn bata a ragidi a xa ne findi a Dii Xɛmɛn maligane ra, alogo Yesu xa lu alo dii singena a xunyɛne yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Ala bata yi na ragidi naxanye xa, a mɔn bata ne xili. A naxanye xilixi, a mɔn bata ne ratinxinɲɛ ayi a yɛtagi, a mɔn yi a binyen fi e ma.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa xanuntenyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Nayi, en nanse falama na fe ra? Xa Ala en xɔn, nde fa kelɛ en xili ma nayi? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>A tan naxan mi a yɛtɛna dii xɛmɛn natanga, koni a yi a fi en birin xa, nanfera nayi a mi seen birin soɛ en yii a Dii Xɛmɛn xɔn? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Ala bata muxun naxanye sugandi, nde ne kansunɲɛ? Ala nan yoon fiin kanna ra. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Nde nɔɛ en yalagɛ? Muxu yo, bayo Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu bata faxa, a mɔn yi keli sayani, a mɔn tixi Ala yiifanna ma, a Ala mafanma en xa. <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Nanse en bɛ Alaa Muxu Sugandixina xanuntenyani? Tɔrɔn nun kɔntɔfinla ba, hanma bɛsɛnxɔnyana hanma kamɛna hanma marabɛnna hanma gbalona hanma sayana silanfanna ra?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.35</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> Ne sese mi nɔɛ a ligɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Bayo a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, a naxa, “E nxu faxama i tan nan ma fe ra fɛriɲɛn gbɛn! E nxu ligama alo yɛxɛɛn naxan faxa daxi a ra!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">8.36</char> Yaburin 44.23</note> <verse eid="ROM 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Koni naxan en xanuxi, en nɔɔn sɔtɔma nɛn na xɔn feni itoe birin yi fefe. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Amasɔtɔ n na a kolon yati, sayana hanma dunuɲa yi gidina hanma malekane hanma ɲinanne hanma waxatini itoe hanma waxati famatɔne hanma sɛnbɛ kanne <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>hanma naxanye kore xɔnna ma hanma naxanye bɔxɔn bun ma, dalise yo mi na yi naxan en bɛ Alaa xanuntenyani en naxan sɔtɔxi en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Ala muxun naxanye sugandixi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>N xa ɲɔndin fala ɛ xa Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani, n mi wulen falama, n xaxinla mi n yalagima. N seren bama Alaa Nii Sariɲanxini: <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>N sunuxi, n bɔɲɛn mɔn sɔxɔlɛxi waxatin birin. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Amasɔtɔ, n yi waxi nɛn n tan yɛtɛɛn nan xa Alaa dangan sɔtɔ, n yi masiga a Muxu Sugandixin na ngaxakedenne funfuni, n kon kaane, <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Isirayila kaane, e tan naxanye findi Alaa diine ra, e a binyen nun a layirine nun a sariyan nun a batu kiine nun a tulisane sɔtɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>E fataxi Nabi singene bɔnsɔnne nan na, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin yi mini e tan yi adamadiyaan kii ma. Ala naxan seen birin xun na, na xa tantun habadan! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Anu, na xa mi na ra de fa fala a Alaa tuli saan tɔnɔ mi fa na, bayo Isirayila kaane birin mi findixi Alaa yamana Isirayila xan na. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>E to barixi Iburahima bɔnsɔnni, na mi a ra fa fala e birin findixi Iburahimaa dii kɛndɛne nan na. Amasɔtɔ Ala a fala nɛn a xa, a naxa, “Naxanye yatɛma i bɔnsɔnna ra, ne minima Isiyaga bɔnsɔnna nin.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.7</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 21.12</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Na nan na ra, diin naxanye barixi adamadiyaan kii ma, Alaa dii mi ne ra, koni fɔ Ala Iburahima tuli sa diin naxanye ra, ne nan findixi a dii kɛndɛne ra. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala Iburahima tuli sa na kii nin, a naxa, “N fama nɛn waxati saxini, Saran yi dii xɛmɛn bari.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.9</char> Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 18.10-14</note><verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>A birin mi na ra, Rebeka a dii firinne birin fafe keden nan yi a ra, en benba Isiyaga. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Anu, benun gulunni itoe xa bari, benun e xa fe faɲin liga hanma a ɲaxina, Ala bata yi a ragidi na nde keden xa sugandi <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>hali ba e kɛwanle ra koni fɔ a naxan xilixi. A yi a fala Rebeka xa, a naxa, “Tadan luma nɛn xunyɛna nɔɔn bun ma.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>A sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui ikiini, a naxa, “N bata Yaxuba xanu koni n bata Esayu raɲaxu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.11-13</char> A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 25.23 nun Malaki 1.2-3 kui.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>En nanfe falama nayi? Ala tinxintareyaan nan ligaxi nayi ba? Ɛn-ɛn de! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Amasɔtɔ a bata a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “N hinanɲɛ naxan na, n hinanma nɛn na ra, n kininkininɲɛ naxan ma, n kininkininma nɛn na ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.15</char> Xɔrɔyaan 33.19</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Na mi fataxi muxun waxɔn feene xan na hanma a kɛwanle, koni fɔ Alaa kininkininna. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Amasɔtɔ a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, Ala a falama Firawona xa dɛnaxan yi, a naxa, “N na i findixi mangan na nɛn alogo n xa n sɛnbɛn mayita i tan xɔn, n xinla yi rali dunuɲa yiren birin yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.17</char> Xɔrɔyaan 9.16</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Nayi, Ala na wa kininkinin feni naxan ma a kininkinin na ma, a na wa naxan natengbesen fe yi ayi, a na ratengbesenma ayi nɛn.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa xɔlɔn nun a kininkininna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Muxuna nde a falama n xa nɛn, a naxa, “Nanfera Ala mɔn nxu yalagima? Amasɔtɔ nde Alaa fe ragidixin matandɛ?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Nde i tan na naxan Ala matandima? Fɛɲɛn nɔɛ a falɛ a rafala muxun ma ba fa fala nanfera i n nafalaxi iki? <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Awa, nɔɔn mi fɛɲɛ rafalan yii ba, a fɛɲɛ firin nafala fɛɲɛ bɛndɛ kedenni, keden binye wanle xa, boden fe fune xa?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Nayi, Ala yi wa a xɔlɔn nun a sɛnbɛn mayita feni, a yi diɲa kati, a ti na muxune bun a xɔlɔ naxanye ma, naxanye yi halagɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>A na liga nɛn alogo a xa a binye gbeen yita na muxune ra, a kininkinin naxanye ma, a bata yi naxanye yitɔn a binyen sɔtɔ xinla ma. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Na nan en tan na, a naxanye xilixi, keli Yahudiyane yɛ e nun siya gbɛtɛne fan yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Amasɔtɔ a fala nɛn Nabi Hose xa, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">“Naxanye mi yi n ma yamaan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">n ne xilima nɛn n ma yamana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">n mi yi naxanye xanuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">n ne xilima nɛn n xanuntenne.”<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>A mɔn sɛbɛxi mɛnni, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">“A yi falama e ma dɛnaxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘N ma yamaan mi ɛ ra,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">e fa xili bama nɛn mɛnni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">‘Habadan Alaa diine.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.25-26</char> Hose 2.1-3 nun 2.25</note> ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Nabi Esayi yi a xuini te Isirayila muxune fe ra, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">“Hali Isirayila muxune yi wuya ayi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">alo mɛɲɛnsinna naxan fɔxɔ igen dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">hali na, e dɔnxɛdin nan tun kisima.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Amasɔtɔ Marigina a fe ragidixine rakamalima nɛn dunuɲa ma a kiini sa!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.27-28</char> Esayi 10.22-28</note><verse eid="ROM 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>A na kii nin, alo Nabi Esayi a fala kii naxan yi a fɔlɔni, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">“Xa Marigina Sɛnbɛn Birin Kanna mi yi en yixɛtɛna ndee lu nun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">en yi luma nɛn nun alo Sodoma taana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">en liga alo Gomora taana.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.29</char> Esayi 1.9. A mato Dunuɲa Fɔlɔn 19.23-28 kui.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila nun Xibaru Faɲina fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>En nanfe falama nayi? Siya gbɛtɛn naxanye mi yi tinxinna fenma, ne bata a sɔtɔ dɛnkɛlɛyaan barakani. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Koni Isirayila kaan naxanye yi sariyan tinxinna fenma, ne mi a sɔtɔma. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Na di? Bayo e mi a fenxi dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn fɔ e kɛwanle. E yi e sanna radin gɛmɛn na naxan xili, “San nadin gɛmɛna” <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Kitabun naxan ma fe fala, a naxa, “A mato, n bata gɛmɛn sa Siyon yi, yamana e sanna radinma gɛmɛn naxan na, e bira. Koni naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, na kanna mi nimisama.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">9.33</char> Esayi 28.16</note><verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ngaxakedenne, n waxi a xɔn ma n bɔɲɛn birin yi, n kon kaane xa kisi. N na Ala maxandima e xa na ra kati! <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>N findima nɛn e tan seren na fa fala Alaa fe kunfana e yi, koni e kolontareyani. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Ala muxune ratinxinma kii naxan yi a yɛtɛ yɛɛ ra yi, e mi na kolon. Nayi, e bata kata, e yi e gbee kiraan sa, e mi xuruxi Alaa tinxinyaan bun. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin bata sariyan nakamali. Nanara, naxan na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, na kanna bata tinxin Ala yɛɛ ra yi.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kisi fena muxune birin xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Muxune tinxinyaan naxan sɔtɔma sariyan xɔn, Musa bata na fe sɛbɛ, a naxa, “Naxan na e suxu, na kanna nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn e xɔn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.5</char> Saraxaraline 18.5</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Koni tinxinyaan naxan sɔtɔma Ala yɛɛ ra yi dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn, na sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui ikiini, a naxa, “I nama a fala i yɛtɛ ma fa fala nde nɔɛ tɛ kore?” Na bunna nɛɛn, alogo a xa sa Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nagodo. <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Hanma “Nde sigama laxira yi?” A xa sa Alaa Muxu Sugandixin nakeli sayani. <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Koni a nanse falaxi? A naxa, “Alaa falana i dɛxɔn ma, a i dɛɛn kui, a i bɔɲɛni,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.8</char> A mato Sariyane 30.12-14 kui.</note> na nan dɛnkɛlɛyaan falan na, en naxan nalima iki. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Xa i i tiyɛ a ra i dɛni fa fala Yesu nan Marigin na, i dɛnkɛlɛya i bɔɲɛni, a Ala a rakeli nɛn sayani, i kisima nɛn. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Amasɔtɔ muxun dɛnkɛlɛyama a bɔɲɛn nin, Ala yi a ratinxinɲɛ ayi a yɛɛ ra yi. A yi a ti a ra a dɛni, a kisi. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Amasɔtɔ Kitabun naxa, “Naxan yo na dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, na mi nimisama.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.11</char> Esayi 28.16</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Amasɔtɔ tagi raba mi Yahudiyane nun siya gbɛtɛne tagi. Marigi keden peen nan e birin xun na naxan a maxandi muxune birin kima a fonisireyani. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Amasɔtɔ Kitabun naxa, “Naxan yo na Marigin xili, na kisima nɛn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.13</char> Yowɛli 3.5</note><verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Koni e a xilima di, xa e mi dɛnkɛlɛya a ma? E dɛnkɛlɛyama di, xa e munma a fe mɛ? E na mɛma di, xa muxe mi kawandin ba e xa? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Na kawandin bama di, xa xɛrane mi rasiga? A sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui na kii nin, a naxa, “Xɛra faɲi yibane faan lanxi han!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.15</char> Esayi 52.7</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Koni Isirayila kaane birin mi na fe Xibaru Faɲin suxi. Amasɔtɔ, Nabi Esayi a fala nɛn, a naxa, “Marigina, nde laxi nxɔ falan na?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.16</char> Esayi 53.1</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Anu, dɛnkɛlɛyaan fama Alaa falan mɛɛn nan xɔn ma. Alaa falan fan mɛma Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe kawandin nan xɔn.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Koni n xa maxɔdinna ti: E mi a fe mɛxi ba? Ɛn-ɛn, e bata a mɛ! Kitabun naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">“E fala xuiin bɔxɔn birin li nɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">E falane yi siga han dunuɲa danna.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.18</char> Yaburin 19.5</note><verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Awa, n mɔn xa maxɔdinna ti, “Isirayila muxune mi a famu ba?” Musa nan singe ito yabi. A naxa, “N na ɛ raxɔxɔlɔnma ayi nɛn muxune xɔn yama faɲin mi naxanye ra. N yi ɛ raxɔlɔ siya xaxilitaren xɔn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.19</char> Sariyane 32.21</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Esayi yi susu Alaa falani ito tiyɛ, a naxa, “Naxanye mi yi n fenma, ne bata n to. Naxanye mi yi n maxɔdinma, n bata n yɛtɛ yita ne ra.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.20</char> Esayi 65.1</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Koni a yi a fala Isirayila a fe ra, a naxa, “N na n yiini bandunma yama fala suxutare murutɛxine ma fɛriɲɛn gbɛn!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">10.21</char> Esayi 65.2</note><verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Alaa kininkininna Isirayila ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>N xa maxɔdinni ito ti: Ala bata a mɛ a yamaan na ba? Ɛn-ɛn de! Amasɔtɔ Isirayila kaan nan n tan yɛtɛɛn na, Iburahima yixɛtɛna nde Bunyamin bɔnsɔnni. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Ala yamaan naxan sugandi a yɛtɛ xa a fɔlɔni a mi ne rabeɲinxi. Nabi Eli a mawugama Ala xa Isirayila kaane fe ra Kitabun kui dɛnaxan yi, ɛ mi mɛnna kolon ba? A naxa, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Marigina, e bata i ya nabine faxa, e yi i ya saraxa gandene kala, n keden peen nan fa luxi, e mɔn kataxi n fan faxa feen na.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.3</char> Mangane Singen 19.10 nun 19.14</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Ala a yabi di? A naxa, “N bata muxu wuli solofere ramara n yɛtɛ xa naxanye mi e xinbi sinxi Baali suxuren bun ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.4</char> Mangane Singen 19.18</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>A mɔn na kii nin iki, Alaa yama dɔnxɛn luxi naxanye sugandixi hinanna xɔn waxatini ito yi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Xa a ligaxi hinanna nan xɔn, muxune kɛwanla mi fa a ra. Xanamu Alaa hinanna mi yi findima hinanna ra.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Nanfe ligaxi nayi? Isirayila kaane yi naxan fenma nun e sɔbɛɛn na, e mi na sɔtɔxi. Koni fɔ Ala naxanye sugandixi ne nan a sɔtɔxi. A dɔnxɛne tondixi nɛn <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>alo a sɛbɛxi kii naxan yi Kitabuni, a naxa, “Ala bata xaxili xɔdɛxɛn fi e ma, e nun yɛɛn naxanye mi seen toma e nun tunla naxanye mi falan mɛma han to.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.8</char> A mato Sariyane 29.3 nun Esayi 6.10 kui.</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Dawuda yi a fala, a naxa, “Ala xa e ɲaxaɲaxane findi e suxu fɛrɛn na e nun luti ratixin na e yɛɛ ra naxan e rabirama, e hakɛne yi saran e ra. <verse eid="ROM 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>E yɛɛne xa rafɔrɔ ayi, e yi danxu! E fanna xa ba a ra waxatin birin!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.10</char> Yaburin 69.23-24</note><verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>N na ɛ maxɔdinma, Yahudiyane tantan waxatin naxan yi, e bira nɛn ba habadan? Ɛn-ɛn de! Koni e to sin hakɛni, siya gbɛtɛne yi kisi feen sɔtɔ alogo xɔxɔlɔnyaan xa Isirayila kaane suxu. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Anu, xa Yahudiyane hakɛn findi hɛri gbeen na dunuɲa muxune xa, xa e bɔnɔn findi hɛrin na siya gbɛtɛne xa, e na a rakamali waxatin naxan yi, na fan mi hɛrin nafɛ nayi ba?<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>N falan tima ɛ tan siya gbɛtɛne nan xa iki. N bata findi xɛraan na siya gbɛtɛne xa. N sɛwaxi na wanla ra bayo, <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>yanyina nde, n xɔxɔlɔnyaan nasoma nɛn n bɔnsɔnna muxuna ndee yi alogo e fan ndee xa kisi. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Amasɔtɔ Isirayila kaane ramɛxi waxatin naxan yi, xa Ala nun dunuɲa muxune tagini tɔn, nanse fa ligama nayi, xa e mɔn so a lannayani? Na findima kenla nan na sayani siga nii rakisini.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Anu, xa buru keden nali Ala ma, e nun naxanye bɔnbɔxi e bode xɔn, ne fan sariɲan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.16</char> A mato Yatɛne 15.19-21 kui.</note> Xa wudin salenna sariɲan, a yiine fan luma na kii nin. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Koni xa a yiina ndee sɛgɛ wudi binla ma, i tan siya gbɛtɛn naxan luxi alo burunna Oliwi bili yiina, i tan yi xidi wudin binla ma e funfuni, i yi lu na wudin salenna igen sɔtɛ, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>i nama i yɛtɛ yite na wudi yii sɛgɛxine ma. Xa i na liga, i nama ɲinan fa fala i tan xa mi salenna baloma de, salenna nan i tan baloma.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Koni waxatina nde i tan a falama nɛn, i naxa, “Wudi yiine sɛgɛxi nɛn alogo n tan xa ti e funfuni.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Ɲɔndin na a ra, e sɛgɛxi nɛn masɔtɔ e dɛnkɛlɛyatareyaan ma, i tan yi ti e funfuni dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn. Nayi, i nama yanda ayi na feen na de, koni a liga i yeren ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Amasɔtɔ, xa Ala mi Yahudiyane ratangaxi, naxanye luxi alo wudi yii singene, a mi i fan natangama. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Nayi, en na en miri Alaa nɛmaan nun a yɛ xɔdɛxɛn ma. Naxanye tantanxi, a xɔdɔxɔ ne ma, koni a nɛmaan fan i tan na, koni fɔ i xa lu a nɛmaan bun nɛn, xanamu, a i fan sɛgɛma a binla ma nɛn alo wudi yiina. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Xa Yahudiyane mi lu e dɛnkɛlɛyatareyani, e mɔn tugunma nɛn e tiden na. Amasɔtɔ Ala nɔɛ e raxɛtɛ nɛn e funfuni. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Bayo, xa i tan siya gbɛtɛn ligaxi nɛn alo burunna Oliwi wudi yiin naxan yi sɛgɛxi a binla ma, i yi tugun taa kui Oliwi wudi kɛndɛn na hali i da kii mi yi a ra, nayi Yahudiyan yɛtɛɛn naxanye ligaxi alo taa kui Oliwi wudi kɛndɛn yiine, Ala taganɲɛ ne tiyɛ e yɛtɛ binla ma e funfune yi ba?<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila birin kisima nɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ngaxakedenne, n waxi Alaa wundo feni ito yita feni ɛ ra, alogo ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ yatɛ fekolonne ra: Isirayila yamaan fɔxɔ kedenna tondixi han siyaan bonne xasabi dɛfexin yi so. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Nanara, Isirayila birin kisima nɛn alo a sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui kii naxan yi, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">“Xunbaan kelima nɛn Siyon yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">a Ala kolontareyaan birin ɲan Yaxuba bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>N na e yulubin ba e ma waxatin naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">n layirin xidima na nan na e xa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.27</char> Esayi 59.20-21</note><verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Yahudiyane bata findi Ala yaxune ra alogo ɛ tan xa Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin sɔtɔ. Koni Ala rafan yama sugandixin mɔn e ra e benba nabi singene fe ra. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa kiseene nun maragidin mi kalama. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Ɛ tan siya gbɛtɛne, ɛ munma yi Alaa falan suxu a singeni, koni ɛ bata Ala kininkininna sɔtɔ iki amasɔtɔ Yahudiyane mi Alaa falan suxi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Na kiini, iki Yahudiyane mi fa Ala xuiin suxuma alogo ɛ tan siya gbɛtɛne kininkininna naxan sɔtɔxi, e fan xa na sɔtɔ ɛ tan siya gbɛtɛne sabun na. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Ala bata muxun birin findi kasorasane ra e fala suxutareyaan xɔn alogo a xa kininkinin e birin ma.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala xa tantun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Alaa fonisireyaan nun a xaxilimayaan nun a fe kolonna tilin de! Nde nɔɛ Alaa fe ragidixine famunɲɛ? Nde nɔɛ a feene famunɲɛ? <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>A sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 11:34">“Nde Marigina miriyane kolon? Nde nɔɛ findɛ a kawandi muxun na?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.34</char> Esayi 40.13</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Nde nɔɛ Ala dolɛ, alogo a mɔn xa a raxɛtɛ a ma?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.35</char> Yuba 41.3</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Amasɔtɔ feen birin kelixi a tan yii a tan nan baraka yi a tan xa. Binyena a tan nan xa habadan. Amina!<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Dɛnkɛlɛya muxun xa wali Ala xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Ngaxakedenne, Ala to kininkininxi ɛ ma, n na ɛ mafanma ɛ ɛ fati bɛndɛn fi Ala ma saraxan na ɛ dunuɲa yi gidini, a sariɲan, a rafan Ala ma. Na nan findixi batu faɲin na ɛ naxan ligama Ala xa. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ lu dunuɲa feene yi, koni ɛ xa ɛ kɛɲaan masara xaxilimaya nɛnɛn xɔn, alogo ɛ xa Ala sagoon kolon naxan fan, a rayabu, a kamalixi.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>N na a falama ɛ birin xa Alaa maragidini a naxan fixi n ma, n naxa, ɛ nama a miri xaxilitareyani a ɛ dangu bonne ra, koni ɛ miri ɛ yɛtɛ ma xaxilimayaan nun yɛtɛ suxuni alo Ala dɛnkɛlɛyaan yatɛn naxan fixi ɛ ma. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>En fatin yirene wuya, koni e birin nun e wali. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>A na kii nin, hali en to wuya, en bata findi fati bɛndɛ kedenna ra Alaa Muxu Sugandixini, en lu en bode yi alo fatin yirene. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Ala en kixi seen sifa wuyaxi nan na, alo a ragidixi en ma kii naxan yi. Xa muxuna nde kixi nabiya falane yi, a falane xa lan dɛnkɛlɛyaan ma. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Xa wanla na a ra yamaan xa, a xa wanla kɛ. Naxan nɔɛ xaranna tiyɛ, na xa xaranna ti. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Xa naxan nɔɛ muxune ralimaniyɛ, na xa e ralimaniya. Naxan kiin tima, na xa a liga fonisireyani. Xa yɛɛratiin na a ra, na xa a sɔbɛ so na ma. Xa naxan kininkininma muxune ma, a xa a liga sɛwani.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Ɛ xanuntenyaan nama findi nafigiyaan na. Ɛ ɛ mɛ fe ɲaxin na. Naxan fan, ɛ na suxu ken! <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Ɛ ɛ bode rafan ngaxakedenyaan xanuntenyani, ɛ yi ɛ bode binya ki faɲi. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Ɛ tunnafanna nama findi salayaan na. Koni ɛ wali Marigin xa wɛkilɛni. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Ɛ sɛwa ɛ yigina fe ra, ɛ diɲa tɔrɔni, ɛ lu Ala maxandini tun. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Ɛ muxu sariɲanxine goronna tongo e makone yi. Ɛ fatan muxune yisuxɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Ɛ duba ɛ bɛsɛnxɔnya muxune xa, ɛ duba, ɛ nama dangan ti. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Naxanye sɛwaxi, ɛ sɛwa ne xɔn ma. Naxanye wugama, ɛ wuga ne xɔn ma. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Ɛ kui feene xa findi kedenna ra ɛ bode xa. Ɛ nama ɛ waso, koni naxan yo magodoxi ɛ tin na ma. Ɛ nama ɛ yɛtɛ yatɛ fekolonne ra.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Ɛ nama fe ɲaxin ɲɔxɔ fe ɲaxin na. Ɛ kata fe faɲin liga feen na muxune birin yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Xa a lanɲɛ, fanni na fatɛ ɛ tan na, lanna xa lu ɛ nun muxune birin tagi. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>N xanuntenne, ɛ nama ɛ gbeen ɲɔxɔ, koni ɛ a lu Alaa xɔlɔn ma, amasɔtɔ a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, Marigin naxa, “N tan nan gbeeɲɔxɔ tiin na. N feene saranma nɛn e ɲɔxɔnne ra.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.19</char> Sariyane 32.35</note> <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Koni ɛ tan xa a liga na kiini: Kitabun naxa, “Xa kamɛna i yaxun ma, donseen so a yii. Xa min xɔnla a ma, igen so a yii, amasɔtɔ xa i na liga a xa, na luma a xa nɛn alo i tɛɛ wolonne nan malanma a xunna ma.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">12.20</char> Sandane 25.21-22</note> <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>I nama tin fe ɲaxin xa i nɔ. Koni fɔ i xa fe ɲaxin nɔ fe faɲin xɔn.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">En xuru mangane ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Muxun birin xa xuru mangane ma. Amasɔtɔ mangaya yo mi na, naxan mi kelixi Ala ma. Mangan naxanye dɔxi, a tan nan ne dɔxi. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Nanara, naxan na murutɛ mangane ma, na murutɛxi Alaa yamarin nan ma. Naxanye na ligama, ne kitin nan tima e yɛtɛ ma. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Fe faɲi rabaan mi gaxuma mangane yɛɛ ra, koni fɔ fe ɲaxi rabana. I waxi i nama gaxu mangan yɛɛ ra ba? Nayi, fe faɲin liga alogo a xa i matɔxɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Amasɔtɔ a findixi Alaa walikɛɛn nan na alogo a xa fe faɲin liga i xa. Koni xa i fe ɲaxin liga, gaxu a yɛɛ ra! Bayo silanfanna mi a yii naxi fuu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.4</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> Alaa walikɛɛn nan a ra naxan a xɔlɔn nagodoma fe ɲaxi rabaan ma, a a fe ɲaxin saran a ra. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Nanara, fɔ ɛ xa xuru nɛn mangane ma, fa fala e nama i tɔrɔ, na mi a ra, koni alogo i nama i yɛtɛ yalagi i xaxinli.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Nanara, ɛ mudun fima, bayo naxanye e rasuxuma, ne Alaa wanla nan na. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Ɛ muxune donle fi. Ɛ lan ɛ xa mudun sifa yo fi, ɛ na fi. Xa ɛ yii seene mudun na a ra, ɛ na fi, xa binyen na a ra, ɛ na fi, xa xunnayerenna na a ra, ɛ na fi.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Muxu yo a doli nama lu ɛ ma, fɔ xanuntenyana ɛ lan ɛ xa naxan namara ɛ bode xa. Naxan na a boden xanu na bata sariyan dɛfe. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Bayo yamarine naxa, “I nama yalunyaan liga. I nama faxan ti. I nama muɲan ti. I nama mila ayi.” E nun yamarin dɔnxɛn bonne birin fala yisoxin ni i ra, “I adamadi boden xanu alo i yɛtɛna.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.9</char> A mato Xɔrɔyaan 20.13-17 nun Sariyane 5.17-21 nun Saraxaraline 19.18 kui.</note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Xanuntenyaan mi tinɲɛ fe ɲaxin ma i boden xa mumɛ! Xanuntenyaan nan sariyan nakamalima.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Ɛ na suxu bayo ɛ waxatini ito kolon. Waxatini ito bata fa ɛ raxulundeni ɛ xixɔnli, bayo en kisi waxatini so iki dangu en ma dɛnkɛlɛyaan fɔlɔ waxatin na. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Kɔɛɛn bata yanfan, kuye baan bata maso. Nayi, en xɛtɛ feene fɔxɔ ra naxanye ligama dimini, en yi kɛnɛn ma yɛngɛ so seene tongo. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>En xa sigan ti alo naxan daxa, alo a lan kɛnɛnni kii naxan yi. En nama haramu sumunne liga, hanma dɔlɔn minna hanma yanga suxuna hanma haramu feene hanma lantareyana hanma xɔxɔlɔnyana. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Koni ɛ xa Marigi Yesu, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin tongo alo ɛ domana. Ɛ nama lu ɛ mirɛ ɛ fati bɛndɛn nafan feene liga feen ma.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">I nama i ngaxakedenna yalagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Muxun naxan ma dɛnkɛlɛya xurun ɛ yɛ, ɛ xa na yisuxu, ɛ nama a miriyane matandi. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Muxuna ndee seen birin donma e dɛnkɛlɛyani, koni ndee tan bogi seene nan tun donma e dɛnkɛlɛyaan sɛnbɛtareyani. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Muxun naxan seen birin donma, na nama muxun naɲaxu naxan bata a dɛɛn gele sa. Naxan a dɛɛn gele saxi, na nama muxun yalagi naxan seen birin donma, amasɔtɔ Ala bata a fan yisuxu. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Nde i tan na, i tan naxan muxu gbɛtɛna konyin makitima? Xa a bira, hanma xa a ti, na a kanna nan ma. Koni a kelima nɛn, a ti amasɔtɔ a rati sɛnbɛn Marigin yii.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Muxuna ndee mirixi nɛn, a lɔxɔna nde dangu nde ra. Gbɛtɛye mirixi a ma, a lɔxɔn birin keden. Fɔ birin xa la a miriyaan na nɛn. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Naxan mirixi a ma, a lɔxɔna nde dangu nde ra, na a ligama Marigin binya feen nan na. Naxan seen birin donma, na fan na ligama Marigin binya feen nan na, amasɔtɔ a barikan birama Ala xa na donsena fe ra. Naxanye gele donsena nde ra, ne na ligama Marigin binya fe nan na. Ne fan barikan birama Ala xa. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Amasɔtɔ en sese mi en nii ra en yɛtɛ xa. En sese mi faxama en yɛtɛ xa. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Xa en lu en nii ra, en luxi en nii ra Marigin nan xa. Xa en faxa, en faxaxi Marigin nan xa. Nanara, xa en lu en nii ra, hanma xa en faxa, Marigin nan gbee en na. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin faxaxi nɛn, a keli sayani alogo a xa findi faxa muxune nun niiramane Marigin na. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Koni i tan, nanfera i i ngaxakedenna yalagima? Nanfera i a raɲaxuma? En birin tima nɛn kiti sadeni Ala yɛtagi. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Amasɔtɔ a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">“Marigin naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">‘Habadan Ala nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">n bata n kɔlɔ n yɛtɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">xinbin birin sinma nɛn n bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">lɛnna birin yi Alaa binyena fe fala.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">14.11</char> Esayi 45.23</note> ”<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>En keden kedenna birin en yɛtɛ dɛntɛgɛma nɛn Ala xa.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">I nama muxune ti hakɛn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Nanara, en xa fata en bode yalagin ma. Koni ɛ kata alogo ɛ nama fefe liga naxan ɛ ngaxakedenna ratantanɲɛ hanma a yi a bira yulubini. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Bayo n na a kolon, n bata a famu Marigi Yesu barakani fa fala donse yo mi haramuxi a yɛtɛ ma, koni xa muxuna a miri fa fala a haramuxi, nayi a haramuxi a tan xa. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Xa i ngaxakedenna xɔlɔxi i ya donsena nde a fe ra, i mi fa xanuntenya kira xɔn. Alaa Muxu Sugandixin faxaxi muxun naxan ma fe ra, i nama a liga, na yi halagin sɔtɔ i ya donseen xɔn. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Feen naxan fan ɛ tan xa, na nama findi ɛ mafala xunna ra. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa Mangayaan mi findixi donseen nun minseen xan na, koni fɔ tinxinna nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla nun sɛwana, fata Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin na. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Amasɔtɔ muxun naxanye birin walima Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa na kiini, ne rafan Ala ma e nun muxune.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Nanara, feen naxanye findixi bɔɲɛ xunbenla nun en sɛnbɛ soon na fɔ en xa ne nan liga. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>I nama Ala kɛwanla kala donseen xɔn. Donseen birin donna daxa, koni donseen naxan muxu gbɛtɛn birama yulubini, na donseen donna mi daxa. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>A fisa, i nama suben don, i nama manpaan min, i nama fefe liga xa a i ngaxakedenna birɛ hakɛni. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>I laxi naxan na feni itoe yi, na mara i yɛtɛ xa Ala yɛtagi. Sɛwan na kanna xa naxan mi a yɛtɛ yalagima a fe raba kiini. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Koni xa naxan sikɛ donsena nde dondeni, na kanna yalagixin na ra Ala xɔn, amasɔtɔ a mi feen ligama dɛnkɛlɛyani. Anu, feen naxan mi ligama dɛnkɛlɛyani, yulubin nan na ra.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">En misaala tongo Yesu ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>En tan naxanye sɛnbɛ gbo dɛnkɛlɛyani, a lan en xa diɲa sɛnbɛtare kanne bun e dɛnkɛlɛya xuriyani. En nama en yɛtɛ rafan feen liga, <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>fɔ en xa en boden nafan feen nan naba, en yi fan e ra. Nanara, e sabatɛ dɛnkɛlɛyani. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Amasɔtɔ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin mi a rafan feene xan liga, koni alo a sɛbɛxi Kitabuni kii naxan yi, a naxa, “E i konbin naxanye tima, ne n tan nan lima.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.3</char> Yaburin 69.10</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Amasɔtɔ naxan birin sɛbɛxi waxati danguxine yi, ne sɛbɛxi en xaran feen nan ma, alogo Kitabun xuiin xa tunnafanna nun limaniyaan fi en ma, en yi yigin sɔtɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Ala naxan tunnafanna nun limaniyaan fima, na xa ɛ mali, ɛ miriyane yi findi kedenna ra ɛ bode xa, ne yi lan Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu kɛɲaan ma, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>alogo ɛ xa Ala binya miriya kedenna nun xui kedenni, en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin fafe.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xibaru Faɲin Siyane birin xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Ɛ bode yisuxu Alaa binyena fe ra, alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixina ɛ yisuxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>N xa a fala ɛ xa, Alaa Muxu Sugandixin bata findi Yahudiyane walikɛɛn na Alaa ɲɔndina fe ra alogo Ala bata en benba nabi singene tuli sa naxan na, a xa na rakamali, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>siya gbɛtɛne fan yi Ala binya a kininkininna fe ra, alo a sɛbɛxi Kitabun kui kii naxan yi, a naxa, “Nanara, n ni i tantunma siyane tagi, n yi i xinla binya bɛtini.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.9</char> Samuyɛli 22.50 nun Yaburin 18.50</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Siyane, ɛ nun Alaa yamaan xa sɛwa ɛ bode xɔn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.10</char> Sariyane 32.43</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>A mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Siyane birin xa Marigin tantun! Yamane birin xa a batu!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.11</char> Yaburin 117.1</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Awa, Esayi fan yi a fala, a naxa, “Yese bɔnsɔnna mɔn kelima nɛn alo wudi salenna naxan a maɲingima, a nɔɔn sɔtɔ siyane xun na. Siyane yi e yigi sa a yi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.12</char> Esayi 11.10</note><verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Nba, Ala naxan yigin kanna ra, na xa ɛ ralugo sɛwan nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla birin na ɛ dɛnkɛlɛyani alogo ɛ yigin xa lu fari sɛ Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin barakani.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli a wanla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ngaxakedenne, n na a kolon fa fala ɛ lugoxi fanna nun fe kolonna birin na. Ɛ nɔɛ ɛ bode xaranɲɛ nɛn. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Koni n bata susu, n yi fena ndee sɛbɛ ɛ ma, alogo n mɔn xa a rabira ɛ ma bayo Ala bata a ragidi n ma, <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>n yi findi Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu a walikɛɛn na siya gbɛtɛne xa. N lan n xa wali alo saraxaraliin naxan Alaa falan Xibaru Faɲin nalima alogo siya gbɛtɛne xa findi saraxa se faɲin na Ala xa, e rasariɲan Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin xɔn. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Nayi, n nɔɛ n kanbɛ nɛn Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu yi n ma wanla fe ra Ala xa. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>N mi susɛ falan tiyɛ sese ma fɔ Alaa Muxu Sugandixin bata naxan liga n tan xɔn, a yi siya gbɛtɛne findi Alaa fala suxune ra n kɛwanle nun n ma falane xɔn, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>e nun sɛnbɛn taxamasenne nun kabanako feene Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin sɛnbɛn barakani. Nanara, fɔlɔ Yerusalɛn taan ma han sa dɔxɔ Iliri yamanan na,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.19</char> Iliri yamanan sa Girɛki yamanan sogeteden kɔmɛnna ma.</note> n bata Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe Xibaru Faɲin nali na yiren birin yi han a kamali. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Na ma, xunnayerenna na a ra n tan xa, n xa Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nali na yirene yi Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe munma kolon dɛnaxanye yi, alogo n nama banxin ti muxu gbɛtɛ a banxin bɛtɛn saxin fari. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>A sɛbɛxi Kitabuni na kii nin, a naxa, “A fe munma fala naxanye xa singen, ne a toma nɛn. Naxanye munma a fe mɛ singen, ne a famuma nɛn.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15.21</char> Esayi 52.15</note><verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siga xɔnla yi Pɔli suxu Romi yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Na nan n yikalaxi sigadeni ɛ konni. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Koni iki, n ma wanla bata ɲan yamanani itoe yi. Nanara, xabu ɲɛɛ wuyaxi n to waxi siga feni ɛ xɔntɔndeni, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>n yi a miri n xa na liga n nɛma sigɛ Sapen yamanani waxatin naxan yi. N yi waxi ɛ to feni n nɛma danguɛ, ɛ yi n mali n ma sigatini, n waxatidi ti ɛ fɛma, n siga na yamanani. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Koni iki, n sigama Yerusalɛn taani, n sa yama sariɲanxin mali na. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Amasɔtɔ a bata Masedoniya kaane nun Akaya kaane kɛnɛn, e xa e yii malan yiigelitɔne fe ra yama sariɲanxin yɛ Yerusalɛn taani. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>A e kɛnɛn nɛn e xa na liga, koni a donla mɔn yi e ma. Bayo xa siya gbɛtɛne bata Yahudiyane dinan tɔnɔne sɔtɔ, siya gbɛtɛne fan lan nɛn e yi Yahudiyane mali e yii seene ra. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>N na yelin feni ito ra waxatin yi, n yi a tɔnɔn so e yii, n danguma nɛn ɛ konni n nɛma sigɛ Sapen yamanani. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>N na a kolon yati, fa fala n nɛma sigɛ ɛ konni waxatin naxan yi, n sigama Alaa Muxu Sugandixina duba kamalixin nin.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ngaxakedenne, n na ɛ mafanma en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xinli e nun Alaa Nii Sariɲanxina xanuntenyani, ɛ xa ɛ yixɔdɔxɔ, ɛ yi Ala maxandi n xa. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Ɛ Ala maxandi n xa alogo a xa n xunba Yudaya dɛnkɛlɛyatarene yii, e nun n wanla naxan kɛma Yerusalɛn taani, na xa rafan yama sariɲanxin ma na yi. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Nayi, xa Ala tin, n fama sɛwani nɛn ɛ fɛma, en birin yi matabun sɔtɔ en bode xɔn ma. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Bɔɲɛ xunbenla Ala xa lu ɛ birin xɔn. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔli a xɔntɔnna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Ɛ en ngaxakeden ɲaxalanmaan Foyibe yatɛ muxu faɲin na, naxan walima Sankire dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan xa. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Ɛ a yisuxu Marigin xinli alo a lan yama sariɲanxin tagi kii naxan yi, ɛ a mali kiin birin yi a makoon na lu a ma dɛnaxan yi. A tan yɛtɛɛn bata muxu wuyaxi mali a gbengbenna n tan.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Ɛ Pirisila nun Akila xɔntɔn, n walikɛ bodene Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu xa. <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>E bata susu sayaan na n tan niina fe ra. N keden xa mi barikan birama e xa, siya gbɛtɛ dɛnkɛlɛya yamane birin barikan birama e xa. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Dɛnkɛlɛya muxun naxanye e malanma e banxini, ɛ ne fan xɔntɔn. Ɛ n xanuntenna Epayinɛte xɔntɔn, naxan singe dɛnkɛlɛya Alaa Muxu Sugandixin ma Asi yamanani. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Ɛ Mariyama xɔntɔn naxan walixi ɛ xa kati! <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Ɛ Andironiki nun Yuniyasi xɔntɔn n kon kaane, nxu nun naxanye sa kasoon na. E yatɛxi xɛrane yɛ. E singe dɛnkɛlɛya Alaa Muxu Sugandixin ma n tan yɛɛ ra.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Ɛ Anpiliyati xɔntɔn n xa, n xanuntenna Marigini. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Ɛ Yurubani xɔntɔn n xa, en walikɛ bodena Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa, e nun n xanuntenna Satakisi. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Ɛ Apelɛsi xɔntɔn naxan a yɛtɛ yita Alaa Muxu Sugandixin gbeen na matoon xɔn. Ɛ Arisitobulaa denbayaan xɔntɔn. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Ɛ Herodiyon xɔntɔn, n kon kaana. Ɛ Narisisaa denbayaan muxune xɔntɔn naxanye laxi Marigin na.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Ɛ Tirifina nun Tirifosa xɔntɔn, ɲaxanla naxanye walima Marigin xa han! E nun n xanuntenna Pɛrasi ɲaxalan gbɛtɛn naxan walixi Marigin xa han! <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Ɛ Rufu xɔntɔn, Marigin naxan sugandixi, e nun a nga, naxan lu alo nga. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Ɛ Asinkirite nun Filegon nun Hɛrɛmɛ nun Patirobasi nun Herimasi xɔntɔn e nun en ngaxakedenna naxanye e fɛma. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Ɛ Filologe nun Yuliye xɔntɔn e nun Nere nun a magilɛna, e nun Olinpasi nun yama sariɲanxin naxanye birin e fɛma.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Ɛ bode xɔntɔn ngaxakedenya xɔntɔn sunbuni. Alaa Muxu Sugandixina yamane birin ɛ xɔntɔnma.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakolon dɔnxɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Ngaxakedenne, n na ɛ mafanma, ɛ a liga ɛ yeren ma muxune fe yi naxanye muxune tagi taxunma, e yi e bira tantanni. Ɛ xaranna naxan sɔtɔxi, e na matandima. Ɛ masiga ne ra. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Amasɔtɔ na muxu sifane mi walima en Marigina Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xan xa mumɛ, koni e yɛtɛ rafan feene! E sɔntarene mayendenma e fala faɲine nun e wule matɔxɔ falane ra. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Muxun birin bata a mɛ a ɛ Alaa falan suxuma. Nayi, n sɛwaxi ɛ fe ra han, koni n wama nɛn ɛ xa findi xaxilimane ra ɛ fe faɲin kolon, ɛ yi fe ɲaxin matanga sɔntareyani. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Bɔɲɛ xunbenla Ala Setana halagima nɛn ɛ sanna bun. En Marigi Yesu xa hinan ɛ ra.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>N walikɛ boden Timɔte ɛ xɔntɔn e nun Lusiyusu nun Yason nun Sosipateri, n kon kaane.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>N tan, Teritiyusi nan kɛdini ito sɛbɛxi Pɔli xa, n fan bata ɛ xɔntɔn Marigin xinli.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16.22</char> Teritiyusi nan Pɔli xuiin sɛbɛ a xa. Yanyina nde a wanla nan yi sɛbɛli tiin na.</note><verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Gayi ɛ xɔntɔn, nxu nun dɛnkɛlɛya yamaan birin yatigina. Erasite, taan gbeti ramarana e nun en ngaxakedenna Kuwaratusi ɛ xɔntɔn.<verse eid="ROM 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>En Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa hinan ɛ ra. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala maxandin nun Ala tantunna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Ala naxan nɔɛ ɛ sɛnbɛ soɛ n ma Xibaru Faɲi raliin xɔn, e nun Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina fe kawandi baan xɔn, fata na wundo feen kolonna ra naxan yi luxunxi to mi na ra, <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>naxan bata mini kɛnɛnni iki nabine kitabune xɔn, fata habadan Ala yamarin na fa fala a xa rali siyane birin ma e yi dɛnkɛlɛya a ma, e yi a xuiin suxu,<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Ala naxan keden pe fe kolonna ra, en xa na Ala binya Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani habadan! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
